<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2001-08-19/01-14_2001-08-19#art_132_para_0> a dzdoc:Paragraph ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2001-08-19/01-14_2001-08-19#art_132> ;
