        dzterm:technicians .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2001-08-19/01-14_2001-08-19#art_140> a dzdoc:Article ;
    dzdoc:containedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2001-08-19/01-14_2001-08-19> ;
